fix: audit pass 2 — dead code, a11y, CSS collision, keyboard traps

CRITICAL bugs fixed:
- index.css: misspelled "::webkit-scrollbar-thumb" (missing leading -)
  meant dark-mode scrollbar styling was a silent no-op since the
  taxonomy redesign shipped. Now "::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb".
- index.html: cookie Accept button had "hover:opacity-8" (not a real
  Tailwind utility), so hover had no effect. Fixed to opacity-80.
- index.css collision: old .taxonomy-cell / .taxonomy-grid /
  .taxonomy-sub-item rules in index.css were overriding the new
  taxonomy redesign because the external stylesheet loads AFTER the
  inline <style> block. Deleted the old rules.
- render-detail.js openDetail: crashed if entry.images was empty.
  Now logs and returns instead of throwing.
- render-detail.js updateStatusBar: entry.tags.brand crashed if tags
  was missing. Optional-chained.
- app.js keyboard: ArrowLeft/Right now no-op when focus is in INPUT,
  TEXTAREA, or contentEditable. They also preventDefault to stop
  horizontal touchpad scroll. New generic Escape handler closes any
  open dialog-style modal (was lightbox + detail only).
- app.js toggleHamburger: now locks body scroll behind the mobile
  drawer (was leaking page scroll on iOS).
- app.js taxonomy delegation: scoped to #taxonomy-grid / #taxonomy-sub
  so unrelated buttons with overlapping data-attrs (filter chips,
  metadata tags) cannot trigger phantom panel toggles.

Quality wins:
- search-engine.js: taxonomy cells now carry aria-current matching the
  active-filter state, so screen readers announce the toggle state
  separately from aria-pressed (which only flips when the sub-panel
  is open).
- render-detail.js: btn-tax-toggle re-fetches AppState.language inside
  its onclick instead of capturing it at bind time, so switching locale
  mid-session doesn't leave the toggle text stale.
- render-detail.js related-artifacts: now filters out entries with no
  images so draft placeholders never surface as broken-image cards.
- index.html: status ribbon labels (Brand/Year/Season/Entry) bumped
  from opacity-40 to opacity-60 — meets WCAG AA on the bone bg.

Archive (dead code purged):
- index.html: removed #hotspot-popup / #hotspot-label / #hotspot-desc
  block — no JS reads or shows it (hotspots go to #analytical-payload).
- index.css: removed #btn-graph-fullscreen rules (element never exists).
- index.css: removed #timeline-scrubber + .timeline-bar rules (no
  markup uses them).
- index.css: removed .tag-pill, old .taxonomy-* selectors (superseded).
- js/modules/sticky-notes.js: removed dead initDockInteractions
  (empty function) and setStickyNote (never called). File kept as a
  placeholder for future logic; commented intent inline.
- core-state.js: removed stickyNotes export (render-detail uses its
  own internal colors map; no other consumer).
- js/app.js: dropped 3 dead imports (initDockInteractions,
  setStickyNote, updateTelemetry — last one never called).
- scratch/ directory deleted (3 one-off migration .cjs files no longer
  needed; .gitignore already excluded the folder but the files sat on
  disk).

CI:
- .github/workflows/check.yml now uses cache: 'npm' in setup-node.
  No-op today, primes the cache for any future workflow step that
  runs npm ci.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 <noreply@anthropic.com>
